<title>PERU: SOCCER-PERU, ECUADOR DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU, ECUADOR DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru and Ecuador tied 1-1 (0-0)</p>
<p>Wednesday in a South American World Cup qualifying match.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Peru - Palacios (61st minute)</p>
<p>Ecuador - Aguinaga (80th, penalty)</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
</text>
